Blackdrift: replace the Focus status-bar notification icon.

Why: the erase-session notification shows the Focus silhouette
(R.drawable.ic_notification). A same-name vector in the focus flavor source
set replaces it without touching the notification code. It is the opaque
white silhouette of the Clean Slate mark (the drift dots would vanish at 24dp
if translucent). Verbatim copy of
blackdrift/branding/android/focus/res/drawable/ic_notification.xml.

Cut against: mozilla-firefox/firefox@6181e6b5f28a8fbae1d5c3ef6f6626b5a2180213 (Firefox 159.0.1).

